---
description: Scholaris focused verification and truthful acceptance reporting
globs: "scripts/**/*,package.json,docs/TEST_PLAN.md"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow [RULES.md](../../RULES.md) and [TEST_PLAN.md](../../docs/TEST_PLAN.md).
Existing test harnesses live in scripts; no npm test framework is assumed.
Run relevant checks within the authorized scope and respect manual-test requests.
Local fixture suites must not target hosted data. Inspect cleanup and provider
side effects before running them. Never log credentials or token-bearing URLs.

Browser CORS/OAuth needs browser verification; Node fetch is insufficient.
Report exact checks performed, failures and deferred acceptance. Documentation
changes need link/consistency/whitespace checks, not unrelated fixture execution.
